<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 108.70 to 7803.36.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 4.45 to 473.55.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.42.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1461 to 1393.</p>
<p>Volume was 514,257,600 compared with 534,412,170 on Friday.</p>
